# L §5.10 point 3, E §4.2 step 5 (tally 2.1.2, issue #46, the user's "2: spec wins, refused"): a reading's own place is
# tested at the close like any balance. y (claims, min 0) is stated at -5.00 PLN with a pad from world: the pad is
# refused ("the closing pads at the place", L §8.4 `<movement> takes <claim> below 0`), and the places it touches are
# refused from there, world included (q). z is anchored at -5.00 PLN: an anchor books no leg, so the place's balance
# is refused from there, `<place> is <b> after its reading at <instant>`, the next day's start too (r). tally 2.1.1's
# refcore tested a pad's other place only: q (20.00, -5.00, 15.00), r (30.00, -5.00, -5.00) PLN.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
source bk "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place y: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place z: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input day: date
input day2: date

move top: transfers
  on day2
  leg cash from world to z amount amt

move p: transfers
  on day
  reads y, z
  leg cash from world to y amount amt + 0 * bal(y) + 0 * bal(z)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN
  day = 2026-02-10
  day2 = 2026-01-15
  opening[y] = 20.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[z] = 20.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

version st
  cite bk
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-03-02
  pad y from world
  anchor z
  stated[y] = -5.00 PLN at 2026-01-31 end
  stated[z] = -5.00 PLN at 2026-01-31 end
ask q: bal(y, 2026-01-30), bal(y, 2026-01-31), bal(world, PLN, 2026-01-31)
ask r: bal(z, 2026-01-30), bal(z, 2026-01-31), bal(z, 2026-02-01 start)
=== expect
q: (20.00 PLN, refused: RUN-PLACE pads:st:y@2026-01-31 end takes y below 0, refused: RUN-PLACE pads:st:y@2026-01-31 end takes y below 0)
  pad: y 2026-01-31 end, pads:st:y@2026-01-31 end of -25.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: top
  cut 2026-06-30
r: (30.00 PLN, refused: RUN-PLACE z is -5.00 PLN after its reading at 2026-01-31 end, refused: RUN-PLACE z is -5.00 PLN after its reading at 2026-01-31 end)
  anchor: z 2026-01-31 end, stated -5.00 PLN, difference -35.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: top
  cut 2026-06-30
